[3.546, "o", "\u001b[?25l\r\u001b[10A\u001b[90m╭───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\r\r\n│\u001b[m \u001b[1mEnable autopilot mode\u001b[221C\u001b[0;90m│\r\r\n│\u001b[m \u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
[0.000, "o", "─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m \u001b[90m│\r\r\n│\u001b[m Autopilot mode works best with all permissions enabled. Without all permissions, requests will be auto-denied and the agent may not complete tasks requiring file edits or shell commands.\u001b[56C\u001b[90m│\r\r\n│\u001b[243C│\r\r\n│\u001b[m You can also enable permissions later with \u001b[1m/allow-all\u001b[189C\u001b[0;90m│\r\r\n│\u001b[243C│\r\r\n│\u001b[m \u001b[97;44m❯ 1. Enable all permissions (recommended)\u001b[39m                                                                                                           "]
[0.000, "o", "                                                                                             \u001b[m \u001b[90m│\r\r\n│\u001b[m   2. Continue with limited permissions                     \u001b[64;226H                   \u001b[90m│\r\r\n│\u001b[m   3. Cancel (Esc)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \u001b[90m│\r\r\n│\u001b[m                                                                                                                                                                        \u001b[75C\u001b[90m│\r\r\n│\u001b[m \u001b[1m↑/↓\u001b[m to navigate · \u001b[1menter\u001b[m to select · \u001b[1mesc\u001b[m to cancel                                                                                                                                                                                                 \u001b[90m│\r\r\n╰───────────────────────"]
[0.000, "o", "────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[?7l╯\u001b[?7h\u001b[m"]
[0.973, "o", "\r\u001b[12A\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n ~/Documents/code/eds/master_1/prod/assethub-spark [⎇ main*%]\u001b[64;226HSession: 0 AIC used \r\r\n\u001b[35m─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\r\n❯ \u001b[mI want portal as per https://www.heineken.com/in. Create new demo branch and don't use existing one as it is fresh setup, also don't "]
[0.000, "o", "refer existing demo branch changes\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[35m─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\r\n\u001b[m \u001b[35mautopilot\u001b[m                                                                                                                                                                                                                           Cl"]
[0.000, "o", "aude Sonnet 5\u001b[?7l \u001b[?7h\u001b[66;170H\u001b[?25h"]
[0.039, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[3;63r\u001b[3;1H\u001bM\u001b[1;68r\u001b[3;3H\u001b[1;35mAutopilot\u001b[m  I want portal as per https://www.heineken.com/in. Create new demo branch and do…\u001b[146C<1m\u001b[66;3H\u001b[K\r\n\r\n \u001b[35m●\u001b[m \u001b[35mWorking - autopilot\u001b[m \u001b[1mesc\u001b[m interrupt\u001b[66;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[0.011, "o", "\u001b]0;I want portal as per https://www.heineken.com/in. Create new demo branch and don't use existing one as it is fresh setup, also don't refer existing demo branch changes - GitHub Copilot\u0007"]
[0.022, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[46A\b\u001b[34m●\u001b[m Autopilot mode enabled with all permissions.\r\n\r\n \u001b[34m●\u001b[m Autopilot objective: inferred from user messages, use /autopilot <objective> to set an explicit objective\r\n\r\n \u001b[35m❯\u001b[m I want portal as per \u001b[4;36m\u001b]8;id=md-145jqkt;https://www.heineken.com/in\u0007https://www.heineken.com/in\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007. Create new demo branch and don't use existing one as it is fresh setup, also don't refer existing demo branch changes\u001b[68C09:45\u001b[66;3H\u001b[?25h"]
