[0.026, "o", "\u001b[62A\u001b[34m╰─╯╰─╯\u001b[m  Copilot v1.0.85 uses AI.\u001b[210C┃\r\r\n\u001b[35m  █ \u001b[96m▘▝\u001b[35m █\u001b[m  Check for mistakes.     \u001b[210C\u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[35m ▔▔▔▔ \u001b[m                     \u001b[215C\u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[243C\u001b[m\u001b[1K \u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[C\u001b[34m●\u001b[m Tip: /instructions\u001b[223C\u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[C\u001b[m  └ View and toggle custom instruction files\u001b[199C\u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[243C\u001b[m\u001b[1K \u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[C\u001b[33m!\u001b[m Failed to load 1 skill. Run /skills for more details.\u001b[188C\u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[243C\u001b[m\u001b[1K \u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[C\u001b[33m!\u001b[m Failed to connect to MCP server \"excatops\": MCP server \"excatops\" connection was cancelled. Execute '/mcp show excatops' to inspect or check the logs.\u001b[91C\u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[243C\u001b[m\u001b[1K \u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[C\u001b[33m!\u001b[m Failed to connect to MCP server \"playwright\": MCP server \"playwright\" connection was cancelled. Execute '/mcp show playwright' to inspect or check the logs.\u001b[85C\u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[243C\u001b[m\u001b[1K \u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[C\u001b[34m●\u001b[m MCP Servers reloaded: 1 server connected, 2 failed (excatops, playwright)\u001b[168C\u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[243C\u001b[m\u001b[1K \u001b[37"]
