[0.101, "o", "\u001b[4;57r\u001b[57;1H\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;62r\u001b[38;245H┃\r\r\n\u001b[244C┃\r\r\n \u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[1mTask complete \u001b[227C\u001b[m┃\r\r\n   └ The fresh Heineken demo portal is fully built and verified in its own branch/worktree — nothing reused from prior demo/heineken branches.\u001b[102C┃\r\r\n\u001b[244C┃\r\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1mResult:\u001b[232C\u001b[m┃\r\r\n\u001b[244C┃\r\r\n\u001b[6C- Pull request: \u001b[4;36m\u001b]8;id=md-pbr80v;https://github.com/aem-showcase/assethub-spark/pull/71\u0007https://github.com/aem-showcase/assethub-spark/pull/71\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (branch \u001b[37m demo/heineken-3 \u001b[m, open, ready for review)\u001b[117C┃\r\r\n\u001b[6C- Live preview: \u001b[4;36m\u001b]8;id=md-11ievwh;https://demo-heineken-3.dev.frescopamedia.com/companies/heineken-3/en/\u0007https://demo-heineken-3.dev.frescopamedia.com/companies/heineken-3/en/\u001b[152C\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007┃\r\r\n\u001b[244C┃\r\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1mWhat was completed:\u001b[220C\u001b[m┃\r\r\n\u001b[244C┃\r\r\n\u001b[6C1. Company content copied and fully rebranded (colors, logo, nav/footer/copy) to match heineken.com/in's look, verified with zero residue/color-mismatch failures.\u001b[76C┃"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[6C2. Assets: heineken.com/in and theheinekencompany.com are age-gated and blocked direct scraping, so real, freely-licensed Heineken photography was sourced from Wikimedia Commons as a stand-in and uploaded/enriched into all 6 product\u001b[6C┃\r\r\n\u001b[5Ccategories (Original, Silver, Zero, Packaging, Lifestyle, Sponsorship) — 11 assets total, each labeled, approved, and globally visible.\u001b[104C┃\r\r\n\u001b[6C3. Landing page \"Browse by category\" cards rewritten and published (preview + live) with real per-category images and working search links — verified live with correct Helix-hosted \u001b[37m media_<hash> \u001b[m images.\u001b[35C┃\r\r\n\u001b[6C4. 6 ready-made collections created (\"Heineken — Original/Silver/Zero/Packaging/Lifestyle/Sponsorship\"), each scoped to only this company's assets.\u001b[91C┃\r\r\n\u001b[244C┃\r\r\n\u001b[5CEverything is verified live end-to-end: PR healthy, preview responding, cards/collections populated with real assets and non-zero counts. Temporary local tooling/files used during asset sourcing were cleaned up.\u001b"]
