[0.114, "o", "\u001b[4;57r\u001b[57;1H\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;62r\u001b[44;245H┃\r\r\n \u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[1mTask complete \u001b[227C\u001b[m┃\r\r\n   └ Resolved all reported issues on the Heineken demo (branch \u001b[37m demo/heineken-3 \u001b[m, PR #71):\u001b[154C┃\r\r\n\u001b[244C┃\r\r\n\u001b[6C1. \u001b[1mIcon\u001b[m — Fixed (confirmed working in user's own screenshot: HEINEKEN logo now renders). Root cause was an AEM shortcode-conversion quirk with digit-containing icon slugs; renamed \u001b[37m icons/heineken-3-icon.svg \u001b[m→\u001b[37m heineken-icon.svg \u001b[m and\u001b[7C┃\r\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[37m heineken-3-beans.svg \u001b[m→\u001b[37m heineken-beans.svg \u001b[m, updated CSS refs and DA content docs.\u001b[157C┃\r\r\n\u001b[6C2. \u001b[1mBackground\u001b[m — Verified via repeated direct fetches (3x, MD5-identical) that the corrected flat \u001b[37m #f1f8f1 \u001b[m SVG (no raster) is live on the exact demo domain the user is viewing. The remaining \"cream\" appearance in their screenshot is a    ┃\r\r\n\u001b[5Cbrowser/CDN cache artifact from before the fix landed — advised a hard refresh/incognito check. No further server-side ac"]
[0.000, "o", "tion possible; asset is provably correct at origin.\u001b[67C┃\r\r\n\u001b[6C3. \u001b[1mStale \"Top Brands\"\u001b[m (newly reported) — Root cause found: homepage cards were retitled \"Amstel\"/\"Tiger Beer\" during the earlier rebrand but still linked to two never-rebranded leftover pages (\u001b[37m /brands/north-roast-coffee \u001b[m,\u001b[16C┃\r\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[37m /brands/quiet-leaf-tea \u001b[m) containing literal coffee/tea product photos and copy — that's the stale text the user saw. Since no real Heineken sub-brand imagery exists in this demo's asset library, removed the decorative section entirely    ┃\r\r\n\u001b[5Cand deleted/unpublished the two orphaned pages. Verified the published homepage now flows cleanly from category tiles to \"Featured Smart Collections\" with no broken/orphaned markup.\u001b[58C┃\r\r\n\u001b[244C┃\r\r\n\u001b[5CAll changes committed (\u001b[37m 102d702 \u001b[m) and pushed to \u001b[37m demo/heineken-3 \u001b[m; CI \u001b[37m deploy \u001b[m/\u001b[37m test \u001b[m passing. Temp scratch files cleaned up. Live: \u001b[4;36m\u001b]8;id=md-11ievwh;https://demo-heineken-3.dev.frescopa"]
