[0.133, "o", "\u001b[4;57r\u001b[57;1H\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;62r\u001b[44;245H┃\r\r\n \u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[1mTask complete \u001b[227C\u001b[m┃\r\r\n   └ Found and fixed the real root cause of the persistent \"cream background\" issue:\u001b[160C┃\r\r\n\u001b[244C┃\r\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1mRoot cause\u001b[m: \u001b[37m search-hero \u001b[m and \u001b[37m category-tiles \u001b[m are two style classes on the \u001b[3msame\u001b[m section element (confirmed via the content HTML). \u001b[37m .category-tiles \u001b[m's CSS rule set its own full \u001b[37m background: rgb(212 175 55 / 8%) \u001b[m (a warm gold tint) later   ┃\r\r\n\u001b[5Cin the stylesheet than \u001b[37m .search-hero \u001b[m's rule. Since both selectors have equal specificity, the later declaration won and completely replaced (not blended with) \u001b[37m .search-hero \u001b[m's \u001b[37m --light-color \u001b[m + \u001b[37m big.svg \u001b[m background — CSS \u001b[37m background \u001b[5C\u001b[m┃\r\r\n\u001b[5Cshorthand resets all layers. This is why the whole landing hero rendered as a flat cream/gold tint even after the earlier SVG raster fix (which was correct but never actually displayed, since it was "]
[0.000, "o", "being overridden).\u001b[22C┃\r\r\n\u001b[244C┃\r\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1mFix applied\u001b[m: Removed the conflicting \u001b[37m background \u001b[m declaration from \u001b[37m .category-tiles \u001b[m in \u001b[37m styles/styles.css \u001b[m so the hero's pale Heineken-green background is no longer clobbered. Fixed a stylelint \u001b[37m comment-empty-line-before \u001b[m error\u001b[11C┃\r\r\n\u001b[5Cintroduced along the way (verified 0 lint errors locally before pushing). Commits \u001b[37m 382096c \u001b[m + \u001b[37m ca0e0da \u001b[m pushed to \u001b[37m demo/heineken-3 \u001b[m (PR #71); CI \u001b[37m deploy \u001b[m/\u001b[37m test \u001b[m now passing. Confirmed via direct fetch that the corrected CSS (no\u001b[12C┃\r\r\n\u001b[5Cconflicting background rule) is live on \u001b[37m demo-heineken-3.dev.frescopamedia.com \u001b[m.\u001b[159C┃\r\r\n\u001b[244C┃\r\r\n\u001b[5CPlease hard-refresh (Cmd+Shift+R) the live preview to see the corrected pale-green hero background: \u001b[4;36m\u001b]8;id=md-11ievwh;https://demo-heineken-3.dev.frescopamedia.com/companies/heineken-3/en/\u0007https://demo-heineken-3.dev.frescopamedia.com/companies/heineken-3/en/\u001b[69C\u001b[m\u001b]8;;"]
[0.000, "o", "\u0007┃\r\r\n\u001b[244C\u001b[37m┃\r\u001b[62;2H\u001b[0;1m←\u001b[m open sidebar · \u001b[35mautopilot\u001b[m · \u001b[1m/\u001b[m commands · \u001b[1mtab\u001b[m next tab\u001b[60;3H"]
