[0.028, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J \u001b[1;97;44m[Current]\u001b[m  Sessions   Issues   Pull requests   Gists\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1;35mAutopilot\u001b[m  NO It is not done, Background is still cream check properly /Users/mohitar/Desk…\u001b[147C5m\u001b[B  ┃\r\r\n \u001b[34m●\u001b[m Let's run the lint locally to confirm before pushing again.\u001b[182C┃\r\r\n\u001b[244C┃\r\r\n \u001b[33m$\u001b[m \u001b[1mShell \u001b[mRun stylelint on styles.css to check for the error 4 lines…\u001b[176C┃\r\r\n   cd /Users/mohitar/Documents/code/eds/master_1/prod/assethub-spark.worktrees/demo-heineken-3 && { set -o pipefail; { { set -o pipefail; { npx stylelint styles/styles.css 2>&1 | grep -A2 -B2 \"1028\\|1029\\|1030\\|1031\\|error\" | head -40 ; } 2>&… ┃\r\r\n\u001b[244C┃\r\r\n \u001b[34m●\u001b[m 0 errors now (only pre-existing warnings remain, unrelated to my change). Committing and pushing the lint fix.\u001b[131C┃\r\r\n\u001b[244C┃\r\r\n \u001b[33m$\u001b[m \u001b[1mShell \u001b[mCommit and push lint fix 12 lines…\u001b[201C┃\r\r\n   cd /Users/mohitar/Documents/code/eds/master_1/prod/assethub-spark.worktrees/demo-heineken-3 && { set -o pipefail; { { set -o pipefail; { git add"]
